      "category": "元曲",
      "title": "天净沙",
      "subtitle": "即事",
      "author": "乔吉",
      "dynasty": "元",
      "content": "笔尖扫尽痴云，歌声唤醒芳春。花担安排酒樽。海棠风信，明朝陌上吹尘。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "3c56caf2e65abb8e6dc06fcbfd93c3ee0a457adf692a82c38f91198c12c7fac0",
      "estimatedOutput": 666,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/yuan-072--3c56caf2e65abb8e6dc06fcbfd93c3ee0a457adf692a82c38f91198c12c7fac0.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "yuan-073",
      "category": "元曲",
      "title": "天净沙",
      "subtitle": "离愁",
      "author": "李致远",
      "dynasty": "元",
      "content": "敲风修竹珊珊，润花小雨斑斑，有恨心情懒懒。一声长叹，临鸾不画眉山。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
